      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 28-year-old woman with a three-year history of epilepsy was evaluated with intracranial monitoring, which consisted of two subdural strip electrodes and eight depth electrodes. On the third day of monitoring, she developed a headache but no focal signs or symptoms."},
